"user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nunit/nunit/milestones/37","html_url":"https://github.com/nunit/nunit/milestone/37","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nunit/nunit/milestones/37/labels","id":4266843,"node_id":"MDk6TWlsZXN0b25lNDI2Njg0Mw==","number":37,"title":"3.13","description":"","creator":{"login":"rprouse","id":493828,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5MzgyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/493828?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rprouse","html_url":"https://github.com/rprouse","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rprouse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rprouse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rprouse/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rprouse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rprouse/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rprouse/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rprouse/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rprouse/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rprouse/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":105,"state":"closed","created_at":"2019-04-28T16:43:10Z","updated_at":"2021-01-07T17:11:02Z","due_on":"2021-01-08T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2021-01-07T17:11:02Z"},"comments":6,"created_at":"2019-07-24T14:15:42Z","updated_at":"2020-12-28T22:09:41Z","closed_at":"2020-02-29T20:24:48Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"In short, the NUnit 3 framework does not select the correct tests when using a filter like `!(test!='Some.Namespace'|...)`.\r\n\r\nTo give a minimal example, suppose that I have an assembly (referencing NUnit framework 3.12.0) with 1 test, called `Namespace.Fixture.Test`, without any attributes (and hence no categories). Running the tests with the filter `!(test!='Namespace.Fixture'|cat=='X')` will execute 0 tests. However, if it references NUnit framework version 2.6.4, it runs the test `Namespace.Fixture.Test`.\r\n\r\nThis is, of course, a very contrived example, and an easy workaround is to apply De Morgan and use the filter `test=='Namespace.Fixture'&cat!='X'`.\r\n\r\nI believe that this relates to issue #3231.\r\n\r\nI have tested this with version 3.10.0 of the console runner, installed with Chocolatey, as well as version 3.7.0 of the NUnit V2 Framework Driver, installed the same way. Moreover, I have added [FilterTest.zip](https://github.com/nunit/nunit/files/3427218/FilterTest.zip) with projects producing assemblies `NUnit2FilterTest.dll` and `NUnit3FilterTest.dll` containing the test mentioned above and referencing NUnit framework 2.6.4 and NUnit 3.12.0, respectively.  After building the projects, the problem can be reproduced with:\r\n```\r\nnunit3-console.exe NUnit2\\bin\\Debug\\NUnit2FilterTest.dll --where \"!(test!='Namespace.Fixture'|cat=='X')\"\r\nnunit3-console.exe NUnit3\\bin\\Debug\\NUnit3FilterTest.dll --where \"!(test!='Namespace.Fixture'|cat=='X')\"\r\n```","closed_by":{"login":"rprouse","id":493828,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5MzgyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/493828?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rprouse","html_url":"https://github.com/rprouse","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rprouse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rprouse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rprouse/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rprouse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rprouse/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rprouse/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rprouse/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rprouse/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rprouse/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nunit/nunit/issues/3328/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nunit/nunit/issues/3328/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}